    "notes": {
        "06ba8019-88ea-5398-af1c-baeb871ad886": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": -160,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nGet Customer and the downstream chain use **customer `2`** — in the PrestaShop demo dataset that is `pub@prestashop.com`, the only customer that owns orders (5 of them). Customer `1` is the GDPR anonymization account and has **no orders** — with it, Find Orders emits to `notFound` and the flow times out.\n\nOn a shop without demo data, change the Customer ID to any customer that has at least one order."
        }
    },
